13. OFFLINE-FIRST ARCHITECTURE

Implement a real offline-first architecture.

When offline:

- Detect immediately
- Preserve authentication
- Preserve cached feed metadata
- Preserve previously loaded content
- Preserve user state where appropriate
- Avoid infinite retries
- Do not crash
- Do not show fake demo data
- Do not fabricate missing content

When network returns:

Automatically:

- Reconnect Firebase
- Restart required listeners
- Detect new content
- Synchronize metadata
- Update Home
- Update Feels
- Update Posts
- Update Channel
- Update Watch Page

No manual refresh should be required.

Use controlled exponential backoff.

